1. Margherita Pizza

Simple & Classic

Ingredients:

    Pizza dough

    pepper

    1/2 cup tomato sauce

    1 ball fresh mozzarella, sliced

    Fresh basil leaves

    Olive oil & salt

Instructions:

    Preheat oven to 220°C (430°F).

    Roll out dough, spread tomato sauce.

    Add mozzarella slices.

    Bake 10–12 minutes.

    Top with basil, drizzle olive oil, sprinkle salt. Done!

